  PARALLEL EVALUATION: TOURNAMENT T_5 vs ISO CLASS GRAPH G_5
======================================================================

  Building G_5 from tournament iso classes at n=5...
  G_5: 12 vertices, 30 undirected edges
  T_5 (regular): H = 15

